<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/normal_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Conviction Applications &nbsp;(Read 990 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=909" title="View the profile of Beguera">Beguera</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=909"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1284.msg12779#msg12779"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1284.msg12779#msg12779">Conviction Applications</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> November 22, 2004, 11:59:04 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<b>Conviction is currently accepting applications for Time flagged adventurers.</b><br /><br />The winds of change are making their presence in Norrath. With new platforms on the horizon it is likely that many will find themselves at crossroads or dead ends. Conviction intends to remain and continue, holding true to its founders design.<br /><br />We design our own strategies and set many server firsts for doing more with less. Quality over quantity.<br /><br />We will continue in the Plane of Time and show Quarm no mercy.<br /><br />We will continue on our journey through GoD expansion, Kod Taz, Uqua, and Qvic.<br /><br />We will face the new challenges that OOW has presented. Killing raid encounter mobs in all zones including Riftseekers. We will do Proving Grounds trials and forge a path into Anguish.<br /><br />We typically raid five days a week Mon-Fri. 6pm-11pm est.<br /><br />If this conviction is within you, visit our site or contact Beguera Razorclaw-application officer.<br />Officer contacts: Zubbzubb / Jeddah / Gilspur/ Shimmerbright / Fyrestarter / Tiiden<br /><br /><a href="http://www.convictionguild.com" target="_blank">http://www.convictionguild.com</a><br /><br />Conviction Firmly held belief, a belief or opinion that is held vehemently.<br />Our good reputation is of tantamount importance to us. We are a closely-tied group and want people of likeminded ideals. We are not looking for those that abuse others in any way, shape, or form. We are not looking for those that break the rules -- spoken or unspoken of EQ -- such as posting inflamatory remarks on other boards that may damage the guild&#039;s reputation, training others, arguing in /shout or /ooc. We are not looking for drama or troublemakers. If you do or are any of the above, don&#039;t come to us. We will take harsh, decisive steps to protect our valued members from such things. If you do gain access to the guild and then reveal these things to be in your true nature, we will take definitive measures to remove the trouble from our midst, up to and including guild disbandment upon unanimous officer vote.<br /><br /><a href="http://www.convictionguild.com" target="_blank">http://www.convictionguild.com</a> 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: December 08, 2004, 12:53:20 am by Beguera</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13540"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420" title="View the profile of Tiiden">Tiiden</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 74<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.convictioneq.com/images/beware.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The Last of the Magicians!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.convictioneq.com" title="Conviction" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1284.msg13540#msg13540"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1284.msg13540#msg13540">Re: Conviction Applications</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> January 06, 2005, 02:34:11 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Update!&nbsp; We now have a completely NEW website!&nbsp; It is fully up to date, and there is a brand new application script!&nbsp; For those wanting to kick some serious ass with a guild that&#039;s going places, head over to:<br /><br /><a href="http://www.convictioneq.com" target="_blank">http://www.convictioneq.com</a><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=370607" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.geocities.com/tiideneq/tiidensig.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br />70 Magician, Officer of&nbsp; <a href="http://www.convictioneq.com/" target="_blank">&lt;Conviction&gt;</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13859"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
